# Inspect before edit

- Inspect relevant files before modifying them. Do not guess when the repo can be read.
- Preserve existing architecture unless an approved plan documents why it must change.
- Keep diffs focused and minimal. Do not drive-by refactor.
- Unused brand-form / interview panels are not the current product UX unless the plan reintroduces them.
